# Explicit re-include for the canonical scaffold template under
# packages/workspace-template/. The leaf name (workspace-template) does
# not match the workspace/ glob above, but we re-include explicitly so a
# future tightening of the glob (e.g. `workspace*/`) wouldn't silently
# drop the seed assets from the API image.
!packages/workspace-template
!packages/workspace-template/**
